flowchart TB
accTitle: Country filtering must gate the content request
accDescr: CloudFront checks the apparent client country before serving cached or origin content. The private origin does not allow direct viewer access.
 V[Viewer request] --> CF{CloudFront country check}
 CF -->|country denied| Deny[403 response]
 CF -->|allowed or unknown| Cache{Cached report?}
 Cache -->|yes| Serve[Report response]
 Cache -->|no| S3[Private S3 origin]
 S3 -->|OAC-authorized fetch| Serve
 V -.->|direct origin request| Block[Denied by bucket policy]
class V inputData
class CF,Cache decision
class Deny,Block warning
class S3 storage
class Serve output
